<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠτᾰλιά</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span> metri gr. in 
			Ep.
		], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιᾶς,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυσσ-ιή</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῆς, ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτόν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>planted
				place,</i> esp. <i>orchard</i> or <i>vineyard,</i> opp.
			corn-land, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.195
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.185
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).161
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				14
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				3.125a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>plant,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἰδία φ.</span> (of Athena, i.e. olive)
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Lav.Pall.</u>
				26
			</span></i>; also of the <i>vine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.44
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i> (?)); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. καλάμου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.714
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>planting-time,</i> i.e. the latter part of winter, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Hebd.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(1).18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>planting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. καρποῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.1003
				</span></i>
			.</div>
